## Component Guidelines

> **Purpose**: Define concrete, measurable rules for common UI components.
> Stitch 2.0 uses these to maintain cross-screen consistency.
> Avoid vague adjectives; use specific values.

### Buttons

| Property | Value |
|----------|-------|
| Border Radius | `radius-md` ({{8px or TBD}}) |
| Padding | {{8px 16px or TBD}} |
| Font | `text-body-sm`, {{Medium weight}} |
| Primary BG | `color-primary` |
| Primary Text | `color-text-inverse` |
| Secondary | Outlined, `color-primary` border |
| Ghost | No border/bg, `color-primary` text |
| Disabled | Opacity 0.5, no pointer-events |
| Loading | Spinner replaces text, maintain width |

