## Do's and Don'ts

### ✅ Do

- Use semantic token names (`color-primary`, not raw `#1A73E8`) in all components
- Maintain high contrast for all text elements (WCAG AA minimum)
- Use consistent border-radius within the same component family
- Apply hover/focus states to all interactive elements
- Test designs at all breakpoints before handoff

### ❌ Don't

- Use thin weight fonts (< 400) for UI labels or navigation items
- Mix border-radius values within the same component variant
- Hard-code colors — always reference tokens
- Use placeholder text as real content in prototypes
- {{Product-specific Don'ts from PRD / UI Spec}}

